            "value": "cash"
          },
          "benefits": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "Atmanirbhar Bagwani Yojna is basically meant for the cultivation of fruits like apples, walnut, orange, kiwi, and persimmon. "
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "list_item"
                    },
                    {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "The line of credit will be provided by the State Bank Of India, Arunachal Pradesh Rural Bank, and Arunachal Pradesh Cooperative Apex Bank. "
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "list_item"
                    },
                    {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "45 percent will be given by the government subsidy, 45 percent as bank loan and 10 percent will be contributed by the farmer."
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "list_item"
                    },
                    {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "There is no collateral for loans up to Rs 1.60 lakh."
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "list_item"
                    },
                    {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "For SHGs, no collateral is needed up to Rs 10 lakhs."
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "list_item"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "ul_list"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "benefits_md": "\n  - Atmanirbhar Bagwani Yojna is basically meant for the cultivation of fruits like apples, walnut, orange, kiwi, and persimmon. \n  - The line of credit will be provided by the State Bank Of India, Arunachal Pradesh Rural Bank, and Arunachal Pradesh Cooperative Apex Bank. \n  - 45 percent will be given by the government subsidy, 45 percent as bank loan and 10 percent will be contributed by the farmer.\n  - There is no collateral for loans up to Rs 1.60 lakh.\n  - For SHGs, no collateral is needed up to Rs 10 lakhs.\n\n<br>\n\n",
          "briefDescription": "The schemes are part of the Atma Nirbhar program announced during the Budget session held in February this year. A total amount of Rs 120 crores – Rs 60 crores for each scheme has been allocated to the two concerned departments of Agriculture and Horticulture.",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Atma Nirbhar Bagwani Yojana is an umbrella scheme wherein all the schemes are subsumed under a bank-linked credit subsidy scheme, which will have a time-bound implementation and participation from various stakeholders – Government, Bank, Project Consultants, and Progressive Farmers. The beneficiaries under the scheme will be eligible for 45% subsidy from the Government of Arunachal Pradesh, 45% bank finance, and 10% beneficiary's contribution. The beneficiary will have to provide collateral security in the shape of land/property or an acceptable guarantee for a loan amount exceeding 1.6 Lakhs in case of individuals and 10 lakhs for SHGs/FPOs. Under this scheme, the following components are included for availing a bank loan: "
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "    Arecanut"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "    Pineapple"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "    Avocado"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "    Dragon Fruit"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "    Orange"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "    Banana"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "    Guava"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "    Tractor"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "    Power Tiller"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "    Brush Cutter"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "detailedDescription_md": "Atma Nirbhar Bagwani Yojana is an umbrella scheme wherein all the schemes are subsumed under a bank-linked credit subsidy scheme, which will have a time-bound implementation and participation from various stakeholders – Government, Bank, Project Consultants, and Progressive Farmers. The beneficiaries under the scheme will be eligible for 45% subsidy from the Government of Arunachal Pradesh, 45% bank finance, and 10% beneficiary&#39;s contribution. The beneficiary will have to provide collateral security in the shape of land/property or an acceptable guarantee for a loan amount exceeding 1.6 Lakhs in case of individuals and 10 lakhs for SHGs/FPOs. Under this scheme, the following components are included for availing a bank loan: \n\n-     Arecanut\n\n\n-     Pineapple\n\n\n-     Avocado\n\n\n-     Dragon Fruit\n\n\n-     Orange\n\n\n-     Banana\n\n\n-     Guava\n\n\n-     Tractor\n\n\n-     Power Tiller\n\n\n-     Brush Cutter\n\n<br>\n\n",
